<title>USA: US Diagnostic to file Form 10-Q late.</title>
<headline>US Diagnostic to file Form 10-Q late.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>US Diagnostic Inc said Thurssday that it has filed for a five day extension from the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commisssion for the filing of its Form 10-Q for its 1997 first quarter.</p>
<p>The company said it will report its earnings no later than May 20, 1997.</p>
<p>The company cited the amount of work involved in its restatement of reuslts from the first three quarers of 1996.</p>
</text>
